<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan banks and markets closed.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan banks and markets closed.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's banks and financial markets will be closed Thursday, May 1 for the Labor Day public holiday.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Friday, May 2.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
